<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39843" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικουρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be an</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκουρος</span>, <i>act as an
			ally</i>, once in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ Μοῖρα</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦγ᾽ ἐπικουρήσοντα μετὰ Πρίαμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.614
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.57
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλοις, χθονί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				937
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				956
			</span></i>; <i>render aid</i>, Foed. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.23
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>serve as allies</i> or <i>mercenaries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.168
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθοῦ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				575b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. generally,
				<i>aid</i> or <i>help at need</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					1452
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1018
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				12.98
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ δικαιοσύνῃ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				368c
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ ἀναγκαίᾳ τροφῇ
			ἐ</span>. <i>provide for</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.27
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσοις ἐπικουρῆσαι</span>
			<i>remedy</i> them, <i>aid</i> one <i>against</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.4.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῷ λιμῷ, τῷ γήρᾳ, τῇ
				πενίᾳ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Vect.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθὴς ἐπικουρεῖ τινι
			πολλά</span> `<i>does</i> him <i>yeoman's service</i>',
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.2.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c.acc. rei,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικουρεῖν τινι χειμῶνα</span>
			<i>keep</i> it <i>off from</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.8.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. c. acc. et
				dat.,<i>furnish, supply,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1630.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
